{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>ונודעה החטאת.</b> And the law of the high priest is the same, and if it [the notification requirement] is not mentioned [for him] it is only because if his sin was not made known to him he does not bring a bull of the sin-offering. And some say that every year he brings one, lest he sinned. And it stated, with all the congregation of Israel, ונודעה החטאת — for the priest: it is possible that they inform him, but there is no one to inform the priest except from himself. And the sin-offering of the congregation is like the sin-offering of the high priest in all its laws. And behold, the high priest is weighed against all Israel:"], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:08:35.712077868Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}